// ============================================================
// Lab 04: Most Recent Network Info Per Device
// Objective: Return the latest network information for each
// device, using records from the last 7 days.
// Table: DeviceNetworkInfo
// ============================================================

// Step 1: Read device network information
DeviceNetworkInfo

// Step 2: Keep records from the last 7 days
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)

// Step 3: Return the complete, most recent row per device
// arg_max() finds the maximum timestamp and returns the
// associated columns. The * means return all columns.
// Grouping by DeviceName performs this separately per device.
| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by DeviceName